msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings/ResetFields.php:33
msgid "Covers wp-login.php?action=lostpassword and the WooCommerce \"Lost your password?\" form — both go through the same WordPress hook. Requests started by an administrator or by WP-CLI are never limited."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings/ResetFields.php:37
msgid "Requests per IP"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings/ResetFields.php:40
msgid "How many reset requests one IP address may make per window. 0 disables this limit."
