#: includes/Admin/Settings/TabSecurity.php:96
msgid "Controls how much referrer information is sent when navigating away from your site. The \"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" value sends the full URL for same-origin requests but only the origin (domain) for cross-origin requests, preventing sensitive URL paths from leaking to third parties."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings/TabSecurity.php:102
