msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings/TabSecurity.php:108
msgid "Enables the built-in XSS filter in older browsers (IE, older Chrome). When a reflected XSS attack is detected, the browser blocks the page instead of rendering it. Modern browsers use Content-Security-Policy instead, but this header provides a safety net for legacy browsers."
msgstr ""

